1132
01:14:37,453 --> 01:14:39,040
Quem se importa?

1133
01:14:39,040 --> 01:14:43,010
Quer explicar oito corpos
mutilados espalhados?

1134
01:14:43,010 --> 01:14:43,976
O imp fez isso.

1135
01:14:43,976 --> 01:14:45,253
Okay, certo.

1136
01:14:45,253 --> 01:14:46,462
