1149
01:15:30,782 --> 01:15:31,645
eu vou ser bom.

1150
01:15:31,645 --> 01:15:32,818
Eu prometo.

1151
01:15:32,818 --> 01:15:34,337
Serei um bom imp, acredite.

1152
